Z||000018||Jaei Sun||10-12-2001||02:05 AM||||Well I'm a person who puts fieros into the sport compact catagory.  Back when fieros where still being made there wasn't such a catagory really.  I wouldn't call the fiero a true sports car, and GM branded it as an econo-box like Galen tried to joke at.  What do you call Mr2s then??  They're sport compacts so therefore fieros (to me and Jimmy) are as well.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://home.mn.rr.com/fierojaei/trans_fiero_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
